Lifted-arc graph-plane determinant: 81 exact grid values, separate degree <=2, det=-|c_l-c_k|^2.
64 coprime exponent matrices have the displayed integral inverse; all lifted-arc pairings sum to -2bc.
60 blowup-boundary cases: explicit integer coordinate inverse and root-basis inverse; every boundary vertex has a parent path to infinity_x.
Mixed-example conductor via normalization module {1,u}: exponent pairs 0..16 give exactly u^2 v^2.
General mu_a normalization monomials are invariant and satisfy the hypersurface equation; both A1 normalization maps satisfy it after reducing V^2=UW.
Postrelease computations complete; geometric and integral maps are proved in the comparison supplement.
